          <svg viewBox="0 0 1600 500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <g fill="oklch(82% 0.04 170)" font-family="monospace" font-size="13" opacity="0.8" letter-spacing="1">
              <text x="60" y="60">JOURNEY MAP &middot; PIPER &middot; LOOKING BEYOND THE LABEL</text>
            </g>
            <g fill="none" stroke="oklch(82% 0.04 170)" stroke-width="1.4" opacity="0.6">
              <path d="M120 280 Q 320 220 520 260 T 920 280 Q 1120 320 1320 240 T 1500 220"/>
            </g>
          </svg>
          <img src="../assets/mec/05-journey-piper.png" alt="Journey map — Piper's experience looking for sustainability information at MEC." onerror="this.style.display='none'">
          <span class="cs-frame__label cs-frame__label--dark">Journey map &middot; Piper &middot; looking beyond the label</span>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-image__caption">
          Piper's journey through MEC's sustainability messaging &mdash; from store
