    <section class="shell section--roomy">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="num">05 / The design</span>
        <div>
          <h2>MEC Connect &mdash; an events app<br />that puts community first.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-prose reveal" data-delay="1">
        <p>
          The team converged on a single insight: <strong>events are how MEC's community
          actually shows up</strong>, but the events themselves were buried &mdash; hard
          to find on the website, easy to miss on Instagram, invisible in store. The
          response was <strong>MEC Connect</strong>: a dedicated events app that helps
          beginners discover events, helps members RSVP and connect with other attendees
          before they arrive, and gives long-time customers a tangible reason to come
          back to the brand.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Discover</strong> &mdash; an events feed surfaced by location,
            community, and adventure type, with QR-code entry from in-store signage.</li>
          <li><strong>Connect before the event</strong> &mdash; opt-in group chat with
            other attendees, designed so newcomers like Spike don't show up alone.</li>
          <li><strong>Earn &amp; belong</strong> &mdash; lightweight rewards (Fire Safety,
            Tent Technician, Hiking Expert badges) tied to MEC's heritage, not points
            farming.</li>
          <li><strong>Community feed</strong> &mdash; ambassadors, announcements, and
            post-event posts that make MEC's hidden community visible again.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <figure class="cs-image reveal" data-delay="2">
        <div class="cs-frame cs-frame--wide cs-frame--contain">
          <div class="cover-fill" aria-hidden="true" style="background: oklch(14% 0.02 250);"></div>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 1600 900" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
            <g fill="oklch(82% 0.04 170)" font-family="monospace" font-size="14" opacity="0.6" letter-spacing="1.5">
