          <span class="cs-frame__label cs-frame__label--dark">Six key screens &middot; MEC Connect</span>
        </div>
        <p class="cs-image__caption">
          Six screens covering the core flows: onboarding, my events, community, event
          detail, rewards, and the returning-user view.
        </p>
      </figure>
