    <section class="shell section--roomy">
      <div class="sec-head reveal">
        <span class="num">06 / Walking through it</span>
        <div>
          <h2>Spike's first event,<br />step by step.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cs-prose reveal" data-delay="1">
        <p>
          Spike just moved to Vancouver. He's an avid trail runner but doesn't know any
          locals. He scans a QR code at his nearest MEC store, downloads MEC Connect,
          finds the <em>We Run the Cold</em> event, RSVPs, and opts into the
          pre-event group chat &mdash; arriving on the morning of with new friends
          already lined up.
        </p>
      </div>

      <figure class="cs-image reveal" data-delay="2">
        <div class="cs-frame cs-frame--xwide cs-frame--contain">
          <div class="cover-fill cover-mec" aria-hidden="true" style="opacity: 0.4;"></div>
